# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# There are no API keys any more. Wheelhouse used to send imported sold listings to an
# OpenAI-compatible endpoint to have brands classified; that is gone, along with
# OPENAI_API_KEY, OPENAI_MODEL and OPENAI_BASE_URL. Brands are classified by you and added
# with "Add brands" on the Brands tab — see the README.
#
# Everything below is optional; the defaults are what the app uses with no .env at all.

# PORT=4000
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# WHEELHOUSE_DB_PATH=./data/wheelhouse.db
# WHEELHOUSE_CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
